statement:
For full lattices \(L_1,L_2\subset K^2\), there is an \(A\)-basis \(e_1,e_2\) of \(L_1\) and integers \(
u_1\leq
u_2\) such that \(L_2=\pi^{
u_1}Ae_1\oplus\pi^{
u_2}Ae_2\). The unordered exponents are uniquely determined; simultaneous scaling of \(L_2\) shifts both by the same integer.
